  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Circular Food Systems in Eastern and Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivered by the Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research,  this investment pilots circular food systems in and around smallholder irrigation systems in Tanzania and Zimbabwe, with additional activities in some other countries in Eastern and Southern Africa. In September 2024 this investment was superseded by the Africa-Australia Partnership for Climate Responsive Agriculture, which encompasses all ACIAR activities in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
